{"name": "The Walking Tower", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hey Axolotl lovers! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Walking Tower</strong> is an isometric <strong>Action Roguelite</strong> with <strong>Tower Defense mechanics</strong>. Play as an ancient walking tower, defend your axolotls, <strong>collect powerful items, and create unique builds</strong> while defining your own challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/53206d04d1b113da3d6ab8152d2f7c62.poster.avif?t=1795291647\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/53206d04d1b113da3d6ab8152d2f7c62.webm?t=1795291647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/53206d04d1b113da3d6ab8152d2f7c62.mp4?t=1795291647\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build Your Way. Play Your Way.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With <strong>40+ items, 8 unique playstyles</strong>, and <strong>dozens of characters coming</strong> in the future, there are countless ways to build your tower. Find the playstyle that suits you and embark on a Roguelite adventure where no two runs are ever the same.<strong></strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/7cbaf5a970db4058c23495643ac161a6.poster.avif?t=1795291647\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/7cbaf5a970db4058c23495643ac161a6.webm?t=1795291647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/7cbaf5a970db4058c23495643ac161a6.mp4?t=1795291647\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Compete against your friends and the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Monthly Leaderboards</strong> are just the beginning. Discover the game's deepest mechanics through <strong>Dungeons, Special Bosses</strong>, and more! Please don't break the game too much...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/1da3e731c7df1ca02159e84d8003d534.poster.avif?t=1795291647\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/1da3e731c7df1ca02159e84d8003d534.webm?t=1795291647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/1da3e731c7df1ca02159e84d8003d534.mp4?t=1795291647\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Thank you for your interest in advance!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We\u2019ll make sure to <strong>shape the game with your feedback</strong> and create an amazing game. We\u2019re leaving the task of protecting our Axolotls to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras_big/0d77fec10c3d5d35aac4679971256c61.webp?t=1795291647\" height=\"1169\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/extras/0d77fec10c3d5d35aac4679971256c61.avif?t=1795291647\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "An isometric Action Roguelite with Tower Defense mechanics. Play as an ancient walking tower, defend your axolotls, collect powerful items, and create unique builds while defining your own challenge.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716440/fd0a51155a2e715173c7c006bc3c599b560abdeb/header.jpg?t=1795291647", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Hack and Slash", "Action", "Dungeon Crawler", "Roguelite", "Tower Defense"], "developers": "KFA Entertainment", "publishers": "KFA Entertainment", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2716440", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "21 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/NACIJ7s-uAo", "first_seen": 1795215600.0, "review_rank": 21}